#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:27
msgid "onFinished(res, listener)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:29
msgid ""
"Attach a listener to listen for the response to finish. The listener will"
" be invoked only once when the response finished. If the response "
"finished to an error, the first argument will contain the error. If the "
"response has already finished, the listener will be invoked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:34
msgid ""
"Listening to the end of a response would be used to close things "
"associated with the response, like open files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:37
msgid "Listener is invoked as `listener(err, res)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:48
msgid "onFinished(req, listener)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:50
msgid ""
"Attach a listener to listen for the request to finish. The listener will "
"be invoked only once when the request finished. If the request finished "
"to an error, the first argument will contain the error. If the request "
"has already finished, the listener will be invoked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:55
msgid ""
"Listening to the end of a request would be used to know when to continue "
"after reading the data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:58
msgid "Listener is invoked as `listener(err, req)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:75
msgid "onFinished.isFinished(res)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:77
msgid ""
"Determine if `res` is already finished. This would be useful to check and"
" not even start certain operations if the response has already finished."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:80
msgid "onFinished.isFinished(req)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/on-finished_README.md:82
msgid ""
"Determine if `req` is already finished. This would be useful to check and"
" not even start certain operations if the request has already finished."
msgstr ""

